  "id": "scenario/iter-15ma-flattop",
  "type": "fyo:ScenarioSpecification",
  "title": "ITER 15 MA 感应燃烧，平顶段",
  "abstract": "常规环、D-T、感应平顶。用于电子热输运闭包与整合编排的对拍；窗口内 I_p 恒定，剖面准稳态，因此零假设很强，任何闭包必须先赢它。",
  "about_discharge": {
    "type": "fyo:Discharge",
    "pulse_number": 53301,
    "performed_on": {
      "type": "fyo:Tokamak",
      "title": "ITER"
    }
  },
  "over_time_axis": {
    "type": "spo:TimeAxis",
    "samples": [
      83.51,
      99.83
    ],
    "comment": "window bounds [t0, t1] in seconds; spo TimeInterval carries no bound attributes yet, so the axis lists the two ends"
  },
  "state": [
    {
      "type": "spo:PortBinding",
      "bound_to": {
        "type": "fyo:Equilibrium",
        "ip_A": 15000000.0,
        "b0_T": 5.3,
        "r0_m": 6.2,
        "a_m": 2.0,
        "kappa": 1.85,
        "delta": 0.485,
        "species": [
          "D",
          "T",
          "Be",
          "He"
        ]
      }
    }
  ],
  "caveat": [
    "★这是一个准稳态窗口：参考自己的 T_e(0) 在 16 s 内只走 −5.2 %，「什么都不做」的全剖面 RMS 就是 4.07 %。任何模型跑完若不比这条线好，它什么也没说。",
    "参考侧只解电流与电子温度两条方程；T_i 与 n_e 是给定的（见各 record 的 prescribes）。"
  ]
}